{
  "key": 19818,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymFinale_Text_OakYouCameBack",
      "en_US": "OAK: So, you’ve come back."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymChallenge_Text_AideWelcome",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome back, Leader {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\n",
        "You have several challengers today.\r",
        "Wins in a row: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "Best streak: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\r",
        "All-time record: {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}\n",
        "(wins-losses)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymChallenge_Text_ReadyToBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "They’ll keep coming until one of\n",
        "them beats you. Ready?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymChallenge_Text_TakeYourPlace",
      "en_US": "Take your place, Leader!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymLegend_Text_Challenge",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is waiting for a\n",
        "challenger!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymLegend_Text_Fled",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} fled the Gym!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymDecor_Text_BootedUpGymPC",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} booted up the Gym PC."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymFinale_Text_OakFirstDay",
      "en_US": [
        "OAK: Good morning, Leader {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\n",
        "Ready for your first day?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_PalletTown_Gym_Text_OakHereWeAre",
      "en_US": [
        "OAK: Here we are!\n",
        "The PALLET TOWN Gym!\r",
        "The builders finished it just\n",
        "last week.\r",
        "As you can see, it’s…\n",
        "well, rather empty.\r",
        "The LEAGUE left the inside up to\n",
        "its new Gym Leader."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_PalletTown_Gym_Text_RivalAsGoodAsMine",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Ha! Easy!\n",
        "This place is as good as mine!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_PalletTown_Gym_Text_OakDecorateIt",
      "en_US": [
        "OAK: Not so fast!\n",
        "Neither of you is Leader yet.\r",
        "But a Gym should look like its\n",
        "Leader, so here’s my idea.\r",
        "Whenever you’re back in PALLET\n",
        "TOWN, come in and fix it up.\r",
        "Furniture, puzzles, decorations…\n",
        "Whatever you like!\r",
        "Think of it as part of your\n",
        "audition.\r",
        "Whatever’s in here when the\n",
        "Leader is decided stays!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_PalletTown_Gym_Text_OakTakeBalloon",
      "en_US": [
        "OAK: Oh, and {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}…\r",
        "Your father always dreamed of a\n",
        "Gym of his own, you know.\r",
        "I think he’d be very glad to see\n",
        "you standing here.\r",
        "Now, your journey will take you far\n",
        "from PALLET TOWN.\r",
        "So take this! It’s a HOT AIR\n",
        "BALLOON of my own design."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_PalletTown_Gym_Text_OakBalloonHowTo",
      "en_US": [
        "OAK: Use it outdoors, and it will\n",
        "float you to any town you’ve\f",
        "already visited.\r",
        "Come home and decorate whenever\n",
        "inspiration strikes!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_PalletTown_Gym_Text_RivalTossYourJunk",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Gramps! Where’s MY\n",
        "balloon!?\r",
        "…Fine. Don’t get attached,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}.\r",
        "I’m tossing out all your junk\n",
        "the day I win!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_PalletTown_Gym_Text_OakRunItMyself",
      "en_US": [
        "OAK: Now, now.\r",
        "And if neither of you turns out\n",
        "to be good enough…\r",
        "…well, I suppose I’d just have\n",
        "to run it myself!\r",
        "It is a very nice Gym, after all.\n",
        "Hohoho!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_PalletTown_Gym_Text_RivalSeeYouAtTheTop",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Gramps!?\r",
        "…Whatever.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! I’ll see you at the top!\n",
        "Smell you later!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_PalletTown_Gym_Text_OakWaitingForYou",
      "en_US": [
        "OAK: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, one more thing.\r",
        "The LEAGUE has rules for new\n",
        "Leaders. A candidate needs the\f",
        "approval of all eight Gym Leaders.\r",
        "Win a BADGE, and the Leader will\n",
        "test you. Hold their Gym against\f",
        "a challenger, and they’ll vouch\f",
        "for you.\r",
        "Then the ELITE FOUR. Then the\n",
        "CHAMPION.\r",
        "This Gym will be waiting for you.\n",
        "Now go! Get strong!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymFinale_Text_OakHereWeAre",
      "en_US": [
        "OAK: Here we are.\n",
        "Your Gym…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymFinale_Text_OakThinking",
      "en_US": [
        "…Your Gym.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, I’ve been thinking.\r",
        "I’ve spent my whole life studying\n",
        "Pokémon. But long ago, I was a\f",
        "Trainer too. A strong one!\r",
        "When the LEAGUE asked me to find\n",
        "a Leader for this Gym, I told\f",
        "myself I was too old.\r",
        "But watching you two battle…\n",
        "It all came rushing back!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymFinale_Text_OakWontGiveItUp",
      "en_US": [
        "This Gym is in MY town!\n",
        "Right next to MY lab!\r",
        "And I’m supposed to just hand it\n",
        "over to a kid?!\r",
        "…No. I won’t!\r",
        "Remember when I said I’d run it\n",
        "myself? I wasn’t joking!\r",
        "If you want this Gym, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0},\n",
        "you’ll have to take it from me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymLegend_Text_RivalEscaped",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\n",
        "I heard the racket from outside.\r",
        "You let a legendary Pokémon get\n",
        "away? In your own Gym?\r",
        "Some Leader. Gramps should’ve\n",
        "given this place to ME.\r",
        "…Not that I’m helping you, but\n",
        "something that strong would hide\f",
        "where only the toughest go.\r",
        "Like that cave by CERULEAN nobody\n",
        "was allowed into. Just saying.\r",
        "Smell ya later, “Leader”!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymLegend_Text_RivalCaught",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: So you caught a\n",
        "legendary Pokémon. Big deal.\r",
        "Guess you NEED a legendary to win\n",
        "battles now, huh?\r",
        "Some of us earned our wins.\n",
        "…This Gym should’ve been mine.\r",
        "Smell ya later, “Leader”!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymLegend_Text_AideWhatOnEarth",
      "en_US": [
        "AIDE: W-What!? That’s {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "It must have sensed the new\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} Gym in KANTO!\r",
        "Leader {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, it’s waiting for\n",
        "you on the stage!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Johto_Text_MentorInvite",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\n",
        "So this is your gym. Not bad!\r",
        "I came with news. Every year, the\n",
        "JOHTO LEAGUE holds the Gym Leader\f",
        "CONVENTION in GOLDENROD CITY.\r",
        "Gym Leaders and ELITE FOUR from\n",
        "every region come. KANTO, JOHTO,\f",
        "HOENN, SINNOH… all the way to\f",
        "PALDEA.\r",
        "And this year, there’s a new name\n",
        "on the list. Yours!\r",
        "Here’s your invitation."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Johto_Text_MentorInviteFerry",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: There’s a hall for every\n",
        "type. Beat every Leader of a type,\f",
        "and you take home its trophy.\r",
        "The ferry to OLIVINE CITY leaves\n",
        "from VERMILION’s harbor. Show the\f",
        "sailor your invitation.\r",
        "I’ll see you in GOLDENROD!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Johto_Text_MentorGymCharm",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Oh, and one more thing.\n",
        "Every new Gym Leader gets one of\f",
        "these. It’s a Gym CHARM."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Johto_Text_MentorGymCharmHow",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: SHINY Pokémon of your\n",
        "Gym’s type will turn up far more\f",
        "often around you.\r",
        "And if your Gym ever changes type,\n",
        "the charm changes with it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Johto_Text_MentorLeaderPerks",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Being a Leader opens a\n",
        "lot of doors, you know.\r",
        "Gym Leaders can get a pass to the\n",
        "EXOTIC Pokémon SAFARI in FUCHSIA.\r",
        "Pokémon from every region live\n",
        "there. HOENN, SINNOH, all the way\f",
        "to PALDEA!\r",
        "Keep a streak going here, and\n",
        "you’ll master your type. Then OAK\f",
        "will let you take on a new one.\r",
        "Catch enough kinds of Pokémon,\n",
        "and OAK will build onto your Gym.\r",
        "And there’s plenty more. OAK’s\n",
        "AIDE in his lab keeps track of it\f",
        "all. Ask him anything!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Gauntlet_Text_Arrival1",
      "en_US": [
        "???: So. You’re the one.\r",
        "Every hall of the convention\n",
        "cleared. Every type mastered.\r",
        "Do you have any idea how much\n",
        "money is riding on you, Leader?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Gauntlet_Text_Arrival2",
      "en_US": [
        "???: Relax. I’m not here to\n",
        "challenge your gym. I run a book.\r",
        "Bets. Odds. Quietly, you\n",
        "understand. The LEAGUE wouldn’t.\r",
        "And the biggest game in town is\n",
        "a tournament. No LEAGUE, no\f",
        "rules, no cameras.\r",
        "128 trainers. CHAMPIONS, the\n",
        "ELITE FOUR, Gym Leaders…\r",
        "Rivals. Villains. Legends.\n",
        "The strongest there are."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Gauntlet_Text_Arrival3",
      "en_US": [
        "???: I’ve put your name in\n",
        "the draw.\r",
        "Single elimination. Seven wins\n",
        "takes the title. Lose once, and\f",
        "you’re out… until the next one.\r",
        "The odds on you are long, Leader.\n",
        "That’s what makes it fun.\r",
        "Speak to me when you want in."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymFinale_Text_OakWillYouBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Will you battle me for the\n",
        "PALLET TOWN Gym?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymFinale_Text_OakThenShowMe",
      "en_US": [
        "OAK: Then show me what a real\n",
        "Gym Leader can do!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymChallenge_Text_AideNotYet",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello! I’m one of Prof. Oak’s\n",
        "AIDES.\r",
        "Once the LEAGUE names this Gym’s\n",
        "Leader, I’ll be running the\f",
        "challengers.\r",
        "For now, the PC over there is for\n",
        "decorating!\r",
        "Gym Leaders who approve of you\n",
        "so far: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} of 8."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymSwitch_Text_AideGoal",
      "en_US": [
        "Your goal: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} wins in a row!\n",
        "Prof. Oak says he has something\f",
        "in mind for when you get there."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymChallenge_Text_NotNow",
      "en_US": "No problem. They’ll wait!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymChallenge_Text_TeamBreaksRules",
      "en_US": [
        "Hold on! LEAGUE rules: a Gym\n",
        "Leader battles with one type.\r",
        "Fix your team, then come see me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymChallenge_Text_CantReachSpot",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm… the decorations are in the\n",
        "way. Clear a path first!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymChallenge_Text_NoStage",
      "en_US": [
        "Tip: put the BATTLE STAGE anywhere\n",
        "in the Gym using the PC.\r",
        "Until then, we’ll battle right here!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymChallenge_Text_StageBlocked",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm, there’s no way to the BATTLE\n",
        "STAGE. We’ll battle right here!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_gGymChallengeIntroText",
      "en_US": "(missing text)"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymPractice_Text_Offer",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} Trainer {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hi, Leader!\n",
        "Want a practice battle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymPractice_Text_Go",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: All right!\n",
        "Don’t go easy on me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymPractice_Text_Lost",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: I… I won?!\n",
        "Don’t worry, it was just practice!\r",
        "I healed your Pokémon.\n",
        "Let’s go again sometime!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Gauntlet_Text_Pilot",
      "en_US": [
        "BILL’s PALM PILOT.\n",
        "The screen is still on."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Gauntlet_Text_WithdrawAsk",
      "en_US": [
        "Would you like to WITHDRAW\n",
        "a Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Gauntlet_Text_ReadyToMeet",
      "en_US": [
        "???: Are you ready to meet the one\n",
        "behind the tournament, Leader?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Gauntlet_Text_Reveal1",
      "en_US": [
        "???: …There’s no book.\n",
        "No bets, no odds. There never were.\r",
        "I put on the tournament. Every\n",
        "invitation, every match.\r",
        "I needed to find the strongest\n",
        "trainer alive."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Gauntlet_Text_Reveal2",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s me, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}.\n",
        "BILL. The PokéMANIAC.\r",
        "…No, don’t look away. Please.\n",
        "I know what I am."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Gauntlet_Text_Reveal3",
      "en_US": [
        "BILL: My CELL SEPARATION SYSTEM.\n",
        "You remember it.\r",
        "I wanted to know what it’s like to\n",
        "BE a Pokémon. A CLEFABLE.\r",
        "Gentle. Beloved. Dancing in the\n",
        "moonlight on MT. MOON.\r",
        "So I ran the machine backward.\n",
        "On myself.\r",
        "Something went wrong.\n",
        "It wouldn’t stop.\r",
        "It kept pulling. Splicing.\n",
        "I could hear my bones change.\r",
        "I didn’t become a CLEFABLE.\n",
        "I became… this.\r",
        "Half a man, and half something no\n",
        "Pokédex has a page for.\r",
        "The hood is so no one else has to\n",
        "see it.\r",
        "And it’s strong. Stronger than any\n",
        "Pokémon I’ve ever stored.\r",
        "Every day there’s a little less of\n",
        "BILL left in here.\r",
        "I can still think. I can still\n",
        "talk. For now.\r",
        "It hurts. All the time. And this\n",
        "body won’t let itself die.\r",
        "When this body battles, I can’t\n",
        "hold it back. It only knows how\f",
        "to win."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Gauntlet_Text_Reveal4",
      "en_US": [
        "BILL: So I needed someone strong.\n",
        "Strong enough to put it down.\r",
        "…To put me down.\r",
        "I put on the tournament to find\n",
        "the strongest trainer there is.\r",
        "And it’s you.\r",
        "Please, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}. Before there’s\n",
        "nothing of me left to ask."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Gauntlet_Text_OptEnter",
      "en_US": "Enter the tournament"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Gauntlet_Text_OptLast",
      "en_US": "The last results"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Gauntlet_Text_OptNotNow",
      "en_US": "Not now"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymChallenge_Text_StatueLeader",
      "en_US": [
        "PALLET TOWN Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}\r",
        "Best streak: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} in a row.\n",
        "Record: {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymChallenge_Text_StatueVictors",
      "en_US": [
        "Challengers who beat {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} and\n",
        "earned the {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_gStringVar4",
      "en_US": "(missing text)"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymFinale_Text_OakHeardTheCheering",
      "en_US": [
        "OAK: …Ah. {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}.\r",
        "I heard the cheering from in here.\n",
        "Sorry I missed the ceremony.\r",
        "I couldn’t bring myself to watch."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymFinale_Text_OakWontGiveItUpSpeeches",
      "en_US": [
        "This Gym is in MY town!\n",
        "Right next to MY lab!\r",
        "The LEAGUE can make all the\n",
        "speeches it likes. Balloons don’t\f",
        "make a Leader!\r",
        "Remember when I said I’d run it\n",
        "myself? I wasn’t joking!\r",
        "If you want this Gym, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0},\n",
        "you’ll have to take it from me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_GymLegend_Text_LightsOut",
      "en_US": "Huh!? The lights!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Johto_Text_InvitationByMail",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s a letter on the floor…\r",
        "It’s from the JOHTO LEAGUE! An\n",
        "invitation to the Gym Leader\f",
        "CONVENTION in GOLDENROD CITY!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0856_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_7_Johto_Text_InvitationFerry",
      "en_US": [
        "The ferry to OLIVINE CITY leaves\n",
        "from VERMILION’s harbor."
      ]
    },
    {
